              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahizofeli yativulira Abisolomu, “Zia ogone na avakali vaviika ava baba woovo yaleka inyima kulinda inyumba yu vwami. Ahene yaho avandu vosi va Isiraeli valamanya ndi baba woovo akuvugulaa kuli musigu woovo, kandi avalondi vovo valaluvilira ligali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
